<!-- DUMMY DATA in the shape the SmartCity letter pipeline really produces.
     The write-off / debt collection letter. Carries the Write Off record instead of Collection.
     Verified against Ellensburg's own C1-LTPEX input files: the record node is
     /root/C1-LetterPrintRecord/letter, the *Details blocks are direct children of <letter>, and
     C1-SummaryLetterExtractRecord is a SIBLING of the letters at the end of the file.
     Which *Details blocks appear is the template's own extract record list in C2M (/lettertemplate).
     Replace this file with a real extract and only the field XPaths may need adjusting. -->
